00:10:04.960 --> 00:10:06.730
This is a contract.

00:10:06.730 --> 00:10:11.780
You must sign this before entering any attraction that may be dangerous.

00:10:12.810 --> 00:10:14.840
What, is it really that bad in there?

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:16.650
Well, I guess that makes it sound more interesting.

00:10:16.910 --> 00:10:17.980
