00:10:17.980 --> 00:10:19.300
Contract.

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:23.790
I, Yuuji Sakamoto, take you, Shouko Kirishima, to have and to hold, from this day forward,

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:26.540
