00:10:40.010 --> 00:10:42.010
Hell no we don't!

00:10:49.390 --> 00:10:51.310
This way, please.

00:10:51.570 --> 00:10:53.310
Please look after my bag.

00:10:53.610 --> 00:10:55.360
Don't tilt it, please. The contents will spill out.

00:10:55.360 --> 00:10:56.820
Certainly.

00:10:58.480 --> 00:11:02.570
