00:14:31.940 --> 00:14:33.230
Miso mackerel!

00:14:33.630 --> 00:14:35.230
Correct!

00:14:35.690 --> 00:14:36.610
What the hell?

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:39.840
Their wedding will take place in
Kisaragi Grand Park's Phoenix Room,

00:14:39.840 --> 00:14:44.100
also known as the "Miso Mackerel!"

00:14:44.100 --> 00:14:46.660
That's BS! You just made that up on the spot!

00:14:47.010 --> 00:14:48.160
Question number three.

00:14:48.430 --> 00:14:50.890
I know what you guys are up to.

00:14:50.890 --> 00:14:54.130
I'm going to answer the next one so fucking wrong you won't believe it.

00:14:54.130 --> 00:14:56.300
Where did they first meet?

00:14:56.300 --> 00:14:57.590
You're mine!

00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:01.460
Here.

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:02.430
At their elementary school.

00:15:02.430 --> 00:15:03.720
Correct!

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:08.140
I'll just have to answer before he even finishes asking the question!

00:15:08.450 --> 00:15:10.120
Question number four.

00:15:10.120 --> 00:15:10.520
When did-

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:11.690
I know the-

00:15:11.690 --> 00:15:12.980
Correct.

00:15:14.320 --> 00:15:17.610
It's useless. I can't compete
with these bastards...

00:15:17.610 --> 00:15:18.620
Fin
It's useless. I can't compete
with these bastards...

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:19.520
Fin

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:20.740
It's over.

00:15:20.740 --> 00:15:22.870
Hey, wait a second.

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:25.640
We're going to get married too,

00:15:25.640 --> 00:15:28.770
so why aren't we getting a ceremony like these two?

00:15:28.770 --> 00:15:30.410
We're joining in.

00:15:33.380 --> 00:15:35.890
Excuse me, this round is still going on...

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:37.290
Can it, slave!

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:41.380
I'm a god-damned-customer!

00:15:41.380 --> 00:15:42.260
You hear me!?

00:15:42.260 --> 00:15:47.620
I want to participate in the
mock-wedding too! Just saying.

00:15:47.620 --> 00:15:49.180
Just saying...

00:15:49.180 --> 00:15:51.400
Shut the hell up, you retard!

00:15:51.400 --> 00:15:53.640
When we say we're joining in, we're going to join in.

00:15:53.640 --> 00:15:56.870
I've got an idea! We'll ask them questions.

00:15:56.870 --> 00:15:58.970
If they answer it correctly, they win.

00:15:58.970 --> 00:16:01.700
If they don't, we win.

00:16:01.700 --> 00:16:03.360
You're out of your minds!

00:16:03.360 --> 00:16:04.490
Oh hell yeah!

00:16:04.490 --> 00:16:09.290
I can wash my hands of this crap with these idiots' help!

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:12.710
Listen to my question.

00:16:13.960 --> 00:16:16.670
What's the capital of Europe!?

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:27.030
Congratulations to Mr. Yuuji Sakamoto and Ms. Shouko!

00:16:27.030 --> 00:16:31.810
They've won the Kisaragi Grand Park's mock-wedding event!

00:16:34.860 --> 00:16:39.280
Let's proceed to today's main event - the mock-wedding itself!

00:16:40.730 --> 00:16:44.740
Please give a warm welcome to our groom!

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:52.500
You guys are so dead.

00:16:52.500 --> 00:16:55.550
Let's introduce the groom first.

00:16:56.190 --> 00:16:58.880
Actually, never mind. That's a huge pain in the ass, and this isn't a real wedding anyway.

00:16:58.880 --> 00:16:59.630
Hey!

00:16:59.630 --> 00:17:03.470
Okay, in comes the bride!

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:24.280
She's beautiful.

00:17:27.510 --> 00:17:28.560
Yuuji...

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:34.000
Do I look like a bride?

00:17:34.000 --> 00:17:36.390
Yeah, you do.

00:17:36.390 --> 00:17:38.420
Well, you don't look like a groom, at least.

00:17:39.670 --> 00:17:40.840
Yuuji...

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:42.340
What is it?

00:17:43.440 --> 00:17:44.720
I'm really happy.

00:17:46.760 --> 00:17:48.840
Hey, what's wrong?

00:17:48.840 --> 00:17:51.930
This has always been my dream...

00:17:52.310 --> 00:17:53.060
Your dream?

00:17:53.060 --> 00:18:00.480
It's always been my dream to marry you, ever since I was a little girl...

00:18:01.040 --> 00:18:04.240
I wanted to be your bride...

00:18:04.650 --> 00:18:11.200
It's a dream that I never thought would come true...

00:18:11.200 --> 00:18:13.990
So I'm overjoyed right now.

00:18:13.990 --> 00:18:18.370
I'm overjoyed that it's with you, Yuuji...

00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:24.090
Shouko, I...

00:18:25.600 --> 00:18:27.930
This is boring!

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:30.500
Seriously. I'm about to fall asleep.

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:32.390
No one gives a shit about your soap opera.

00:18:32.390 --> 00:18:35.070
Hurry up and get it over with.

00:18:35.070 --> 00:18:37.530
We lead busy lives, you know?

00:18:37.530 --> 00:18:41.300
We don't have time to listen to your crap. Skip to the important part.

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:46.190
And come on, your dream is to be a bride? Are you twelve?

00:18:46.190 --> 00:18:48.070
Honestly, it's pretty creepy.

00:18:48.070 --> 00:18:50.860
Oh, I've got it. This is just a big joke, isn't it?

00:18:53.950 --> 00:18:56.500
What the fuck are you talking about?

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:59.040
Do you two not have any respect?

00:18:59.040 --> 00:19:01.590
Get the hell out of here!

00:19:01.590 --> 00:19:03.420
Stop it, Yoshii!

00:19:03.420 --> 00:19:05.880
All our efforts will go to waste!

00:19:05.880 --> 00:19:06.710
But...

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:07.860
Calm down, Yoshii!

00:19:07.860 --> 00:19:09.600
But Kirishima-
Calm down, Yoshii!

00:19:09.600 --> 00:19:10.880
Please!

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:15.660
Shouko...

00:19:23.060 --> 00:19:25.880
Yoshii, did you find her?

00:19:25.880 --> 00:19:27.110
Nope.

00:19:30.670 --> 00:19:33.910
Yuuji, where's Kirishima?!

00:19:33.910 --> 00:19:34.910
I don't know.

00:19:34.910 --> 00:19:36.050
What?

00:19:36.050 --> 00:19:37.590
Don't you have any idea where she might be?

00:19:37.590 --> 00:19:38.750
If we don't find her...

00:19:38.750 --> 00:19:40.500
Sorry, but I'm not interested in this crap.

00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:43.040
It's a total pain in the ass.

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:44.160
Anyway, I need to go take a piss.

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:44.790
How could you?

00:19:44.790 --> 00:19:47.250
I'm about to burst. See you guys later.

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:53.840
Man, that was so retarded.
Mock-wedding? Give me a break.

00:19:53.840 --> 00:19:56.850
My dream is to be your bride.

00:19:56.850 --> 00:19:59.050
How was that?

00:20:00.210 --> 00:20:02.900
You sounded just like her! Hilarious!

00:20:03.520 --> 00:20:04.980
Hey, you two.

00:20:06.260 --> 00:20:07.940
You got something to say, kid?

00:20:07.940 --> 00:20:10.690
Well, nothing too important.

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:14.910
I JUST WANT YOU TO TAKE YOUR SHIT BACK!

00:20:25.830 --> 00:20:26.700
Hey.

00:20:28.210 --> 00:20:30.340
You took your time, Shouko.

00:20:30.730 --> 00:20:31.880
Why are you...?

00:20:31.880 --> 00:20:33.550
I thought you'd come here.

00:20:36.260 --> 00:20:37.500
Yuuji.

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:38.310
What?

00:20:38.310 --> 00:20:40.850
Do you think my dream is weird?

00:20:42.850 --> 00:20:45.690
Shouko, I'll say this now.

00:20:47.360 --> 00:20:50.360
Your feelings for me are misplaced.

00:20:51.320 --> 00:20:55.920
I got you involved in this because I was an idiot seven years ago.

00:20:55.920 --> 00:20:58.990
I was just trying to take responsibility.

00:21:00.660 --> 00:21:05.210
You've wasted this much time because of me.

00:21:08.210 --> 00:21:10.630
I'm sorry.

00:21:10.630 --> 00:21:12.510
Yuuji...

00:21:12.510 --> 00:21:15.340
I won't laugh at your dream.

00:21:18.390 --> 00:21:20.750
Even though you've got the wrong guy...

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:24.560
I think it's pretty awesome that you can stay faithful to one person for so long.

00:21:24.890 --> 00:21:30.980
So take pride in your dream. Don't let anyone tell you it's worthless.

00:21:31.190 --> 00:21:36.000
Still, though, you've got the wrong guy.

00:21:37.240 --> 00:21:40.520
Well, it was supposed to help you gain experience, after all...

00:21:40.520 --> 00:21:42.910
I don't think they'll mind if you take a souvenir or two.

00:21:42.910 --> 00:21:44.290
Yuuji...

00:21:44.290 --> 00:21:46.080
Oh, and...

00:21:48.090 --> 00:21:51.090
Your cooking's great.

00:21:53.170 --> 00:21:54.100
Let's go.

00:21:54.100 --> 00:21:56.080
I don't want people to get the wrong idea if we're late.

00:21:56.550 --> 00:21:57.590
Yuuji!

00:21:58.410 --> 00:21:59.550
What is it?

00:21:59.550 --> 00:22:04.330
I don't think my feelings are misplaced!

00:22:21.080 --> 00:22:28.350
I knew it. My first kiss tasted like strawberry milk

00:22:28.350 --> 00:22:34.970
The sun is setting as I push my bike home

00:22:35.600 --> 00:22:39.960
In my dreamy mind, there's a simulation of delusions

00:22:39.960 --> 00:22:40.890
Here

00:22:40.890 --> 00:22:41.770
Where?

00:22:41.770 --> 00:22:42.880
There

00:22:42.880 --> 00:22:48.270
I trip 7 times, but fall 8 times

00:22:50.160 --> 00:22:57.360
Everyday is an anniversary

00:22:57.360 --> 00:23:03.380
Let's connect them together to the sky

00:23:04.690 --> 00:23:11.920
Don't you feel that one day you'll become something big?

00:23:11.920 --> 00:23:18.150
Surely, tomorrow will be sunny...

00:23:19.240 --> 00:23:23.540
with a chance of smiles.

00:23:36.820 --> 00:23:38.120
Question 8:

00:23:38.120 --> 00:23:41.490
How would you say "computer" in Japanese?

00:23:41.490 --> 00:23:43.420
Super electric brain!

00:23:43.420 --> 00:23:44.760
That sounds powerful.

00:23:44.760 --> 00:23:48.430
Next episode: Rampage and Maze and Beings Instrumentality Project.

00:23:48.430 --> 00:23:50.390
This will be on your test.
